            "prompt": "Create a beautiful finished portrait 4:5 mobile puzzle clean plate, target1280x1600: a winding earthen meadow path bordered by mixed late-summer wildflowers, wide intimate view slightly above. Polished dimensional warm storybook digital painting, softly brushed natural textures, fine foliage and dusty path details, upper-left late-afternoon sunshine, no landmark, text, people, UI, border or watermark. Dominant cocoa brown and tawny tan: broad rich warm brown path fills lower center and curls toward distant brown grassy hills; dry golden-brown grasses occupy most of scene, with selective sage leaves and tiny mauve/cream flowers. Top fifth small warm pale blue sky with no distinct clouds yet. On upper-left show a slim tree trunk with a short bare side branch ending around x20%,y25%, no foreground leaf cluster there. Upper-right a separate small shrub with a thin bare branch ending x80%,y33%, without its foreground cluster. In lower-left soil around x16%,y84% reserve natural space for one delicate flower frond; at lower-right x82%,y87% reserve natural bare soil for a tuft of dry grass. Keep all surfaces fully painted, no holes or placeholder marks. Later parts will be autumn leaf twig, different sage shrub sprig, one wildflower stem, one golden grass tuft, and a wispy cloud. Paint scene naturally complete without those five foreground parts.",
